{"id":"832f53dc90c8947a","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-arith.md","title":"算术层级的元数递归定义","display":"df-arith — 算术层级的元数递归定义","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-arith","aliases":["20-df-arith"],"display":"df-arith — 算术层级的元数递归定义","chapter":"4","section":"4.1","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definitions 4.1.2–4.1.3","source_pdf_pages":[116],"source_printed_pages":[80],"depends_on":["[[20-df-recursive]]","[[20-df-pairing]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-arith"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-arith</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arith — 算术层级的元数递归定义"},{"key":"chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"section","html":"4.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definitions 4.1.2–4.1.3"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>116</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>80</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\ge1\">\\(k\\ge1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>；各集合族的载体是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\omega^k)\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\omega^k)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a>。</p>\n<p>上标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tot}\">\\(\\mathrm{tot}\\)</span> 表示全定义限制：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\\)</span>；相对族采用同一限制。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arith}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\Sigma^0_{0,k}=\\Pi^0_{0,k}:=\\{R\\subseteq\\omega^k:\\chi_R\\in\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\},\\\\\n\\Sigma^0_{n+1,k}:=\\{\\{\\vec x:\\exists y\\in\\omega\\ ((\\vec x,y)\\in B)\\}:B\\in\\Pi^0_{n,k+1}\\},\\\\\n\\Pi^0_{n+1,k}:=\\{\\omega^k\\setminus B:B\\in\\Sigma^0_{n+1,k}\\},\\qquad\n\\Delta^0_{n,k}:=\\Sigma^0_{n,k}\\cap\\Pi^0_{n,k},\\\\\n\\Sigma^0_n:=\\Sigma^0_{n,1},\\quad\\Pi^0_n:=\\Pi^0_{n,1},\\quad\\Delta^0_n:=\\Delta^0_{n,1}.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arith}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\Sigma^0_{0,k}=\\Pi^0_{0,k}:=\\{R\\subseteq\\omega^k:\\chi_R\\in\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\},\\\\\n\\Sigma^0_{n+1,k}:=\\{\\{\\vec x:\\exists y\\in\\omega\\ ((\\vec x,y)\\in B)\\}:B\\in\\Pi^0_{n,k+1}\\},\\\\\n\\Pi^0_{n+1,k}:=\\{\\omega^k\\setminus B:B\\in\\Sigma^0_{n+1,k}\\},\\qquad\n\\Delta^0_{n,k}:=\\Sigma^0_{n,k}\\cap\\Pi^0_{n,k},\\\\\n\\Sigma^0_n:=\\Sigma^0_{n,1},\\quad\\Pi^0_n:=\\Pi^0_{n,1},\\quad\\Delta^0_n:=\\Delta^0_{n,1}.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>采用本书把 level 0 设为全部可计算关系的约定。元数标记避免一元集合与二元矩阵混淆。多变量块可通过配对编码成一个量词。层级是集合族，不是单个数集。</p>\n<p>来源：Definitions 4.1.2–4.1.3；印刷页 80；PDF 第 116 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"d6dc5974baa6f8a5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"d6dc5974baa6f8a5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-recursive]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-recursive]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(\\omega^k)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{tot}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arith}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\Sigma^0_{0,k}=\\Pi^0_{0,k}:=\\{R\\subseteq\\omega^k:\\chi_R\\in\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\},\\\\\n\\Sigma^0_{n+1,k}:=\\{\\{\\vec x:\\exists y\\in\\omega\\ ((\\vec x,y)\\in B)\\}:B\\in\\Pi^0_{n,k+1}\\},\\\\\n\\Pi^0_{n+1,k}:=\\{\\omega^k\\setminus B:B\\in\\Sigma^0_{n+1,k}\\},\\qquad\n\\Delta^0_{n,k}:=\\Sigma^0_{n,k}\\cap\\Pi^0_{n,k},\\\\\n\\Sigma^0_n:=\\Sigma^0_{n,1},\\quad\\Pi^0_n:=\\Pi^0_{n,1},\\quad\\Delta^0_n:=\\Delta^0_{n,1}.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":1682,"backlinks":[{"id":"0fd6cd0f446ce1cc","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-arith]]。"},{"id":"88fbecf58d4e0c66","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-1gen]]；see [[20-df-arith]]；see [[20-df-dense-strings]]。"},{"id":"8251b2f9fd838667","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-arith]]；see [[20-df-relative-ce]]。"},{"id":"422e06e55bbb8b2f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-arith]]；see [[20-df-mred]]。"},{"id":"296494bb2dbabc67","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-arith]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。"},{"id":"e1b896a0e27f3a8f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-arith]]；see [[20-df-rel-arith]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。"},{"id":"d88d5d86db02e1a1","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-arith]]；see [[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。"},{"id":"eedfed81ed59c040","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerp